*** Settings ***
Documentation     Digital.ai Testing — Android native test (Appium Server project), generated by the Digital.ai Testing MCP.
...               Run:  pip install -r requirements.txt  then  robot tests/AndroidNative.robot
Library           AppiumLibrary    timeout=10
Library           DigitalAiReport.py
Test Setup        Open Cloud Session
Test Teardown     Close Cloud Session

*** Variables ***
${REMOTE_URL}       [Enter Instance here]/wd/hub
# The DIGITAL_AI_ACCESS_KEY environment variable wins; the value after "=" is the fallback. Remove the fallback before committing.
${ACCESS_KEY}       %{DIGITAL_AI_ACCESS_KEY=[Enter Your Access key here]}
${TEST_NAME}        [Enter Test Name here]
&{CAPABILITIES}     platformName=Android
...                 appium:automationName=UiAutomator2
...                 digitalai:accessKey=${ACCESS_KEY}
...                 digitalai:testName=${TEST_NAME}
...                 digitalai:deviceQuery=@os='android' and @category='[Enter PHONE/TABLET here]'
...                 appium:app=cloud:com.experitest.ExperiBank/.LoginActivity
...                 appium:appPackage=com.experitest.ExperiBank
...                 appium:appActivity=.LoginActivity
...                 appium:autoGrantPermissions=${True}

